       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REPORT.
       AUTHOR. THESIS-FIXTURE.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY DATEUTIL.
       01  WS-TOTAL-REVENUE       PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
       01  WS-TOTAL-EXPENSES      PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
       01  WS-NET-PROFIT          PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
       01  WS-RECORD-COUNT        PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           PERFORM GENERATE-REPORT
           STOP RUN.

       GENERATE-REPORT.
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE(1:4) TO WS-YEAR
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE(5:2) TO WS-MONTH
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE(7:2) TO WS-DAY
           STRING WS-YEAR '-' WS-MONTH '-' WS-DAY
               DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-DATE-FORMATTED
           COMPUTE WS-NET-PROFIT =
               WS-TOTAL-REVENUE - WS-TOTAL-EXPENSES
           DISPLAY 'Monthly Report: ' WS-DATE-FORMATTED
           DISPLAY 'Revenue:  ' WS-TOTAL-REVENUE
           DISPLAY 'Expenses: ' WS-TOTAL-EXPENSES
           DISPLAY 'Profit:   ' WS-NET-PROFIT
           DISPLAY 'Records:  ' WS-RECORD-COUNT.
